  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RICHES: Reducing Incidence of Child labor and Harmful Conditions of Work in Economic Strengthening Initiatives</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The RICHES project aims to integrate the issues of child labor alleviation and acceptable conditions of work into women&apos;s economic empowerment initiatives. By putting a new toolkit directly in the hands of policy makers and service providers who work with women entrepreneurs, RICHES seeks to ensure women-led enterprises can improve livelihoods responsibly without resorting to child labor or other harmful labor practices.</narrative>
  </description>
